  "instructions": [
    "Whisk the gochujang, soy sauce, and sugar until the glaze is smooth.",
    "Sear the chicken thighs in hot oil without moving them until deeply browned underneath.",
    "Turn the chicken and cook the second side until browned and nearly cooked through.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and stir just until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the gochujang glaze and turn the chicken until the sauce thickens and coats every piece.",
    "Finish the chicken with sliced green onions and serve it hot."
